Extension: BackgroundImage
Id: background-image
Title: "Background Image"
Description: "Image displayed as the background of a Questionnaire item. Used by the image-annotation itemControl of a repeatable group: the url of the image to annotate; the first two child items (decimal) store the marker position as a percentage of the image width and height."
* valueAttachment 1..1
* ^url = "http://aidbox.io/questionnaire-backgroundImage"
